    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115710" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψῐθύ̆ρ-ισμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>whispering,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψ. τὸ ναυτικόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.546
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Antiphil.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόλια ψ.</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
				3.3
			</span></i> (Inscr.Cyzic.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> any <i>low whispering noise,</i> as of trees
				<i>rustling,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				1.1
			</span></i>.</div>
